# ── Secrets & credentials ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing in this list may ever be committed. See docs/SECURITY.md.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config/*.json
!config/*.example.json
data/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
certs/
*.pem
*.key

# ── Personal / private assets ────────────────────────────────────────────
